  "id": "mytelase",
  "term": "Mytelase",
  "definition": "Mytelase is ambenonium chloride, a drug that acts on the parasympathetic nervous system. It works by reversibly blocking acetylcholinesterase, which prevents the breakdown of acetylcholine and prolongs its action at nicotinic receptors in the neuromuscular junction.",
